WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,590
Not bad

2
00:00:03,590 --> 00:00:05,590
This is a good helper for directors

3
00:00:06,590 --> 00:00:07,590
Thank you, future sister

4
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:10,590
I think Tianzhu is like a wooden device there.

5
00:00:10,590 --> 00:00:11,590
No eyesight at all

6
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:13,590
I feel uncomfortable when this crazy woman loses her yin and yang for a day, right?

7
00:00:13,590 --> 00:00:15,590
I really think I have no temper

8
00:00:15,590 --> 00:00:16,590
My brother is good

9
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:18,590
I've only been in the door for a few seconds.

10
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:20,590
The room was already filled with the smell of swords and gunpowder.

11
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:22,590
Having too many women is indeed a disaster

12
00:00:22,590 --> 00:00:23,590
The monsters outside haven't come yet

13
00:00:23,590 --> 00:00:25,590
The room needs to be quiet first.

14
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:27,590
Fortunately, my assistant is a big man.

15
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:28,590
It saves a lot of trouble to go straight there.

16
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:35,400
Fifteen gold and iron sword heads are inside

17
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:37,400
If the damage is not serious, it can be recycled.

18
00:00:37,400 --> 00:00:39,590
Thank you Mr. Chen

19
00:00:39,590 --> 00:00:41,590
Now the monsters who have been there for seven days and nights can be saved.

20
00:00:41,590 --> 00:00:42,590
Boss Chen

21
00:00:42,590 --> 00:00:43,590
Take the liberty to ask

22
00:00:43,590 --> 00:00:45,590
This Lianlu was made by you using blueprints

23
00:00:45,590 --> 00:00:47,590
Or is it the product of your talent?

24
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:51,420
Then boss, can you make more sword stones and sell them to me?
